@startuml US_3_2_2_C1
title US 3.2.2 - Cenário de carregamento de role

actor User
participant SPA as "SPA (AuthService/Layout)"
participant API as "AuthController"
database DB as "PortContext"

User -> SPA: autenticado
SPA -> API: GET /api/auth/role
API -> DB: procurar AppUser + roles ativos
DB --> API: roles
API --> SPA: roles ou 403
SPA -> User: menus/opções por role

@enduml
